 "defect_observations": [
  "Route: the owned body and annex files are not yet \\input on the handbook route. handbook/parts/p02/first-order-logic.tex:4 inputs only parts/p02/first-order-depth, and handbook/annex/p02.tex:21 has no input for the annex file. The packet's insertion points are pending integration (lead_owned); this is not a writing gap.",
  "The host table rows for Monadic FOL and Bernays-Schonfinkel (first-order-depth.tex:199-210 and 238-248) cite Lewis1980, which is not listed in spec/coverage/edition-2026/held-sources.json. The host is read-only for this packet (lead_owned).",
  "The host table rows do not point to the decision-procedure subsections. The link runs one way only: from the body (lines 5-17, 143-144, 227-228 and 502-503) to tab:p02-decidable-fragments. Adding back-links needs an edit to the read-only host (lead_owned).",
  "Body line 925 says Part 14 'lists the same rows' in tab:p14-dc-finite. That table (decidability-and-complexity.tex:300-308) has monadic, FO2 and guarded rows but no Bernays-Schonfinkel row. The sentence can be reworded inside the packet (writable); adding a P14 row is lead_owned.",
  "Imported premise (iii) of def:p02-w02-p02-035-domino-import (body 75-84) is BGG Thm 6.1.2, whose vertical relation the source itself leaves as an exercise (noted at body 82-84). All three NEXPTIME lower bounds rest on it. They are marked as imported premises and are not presented as proved.",
